! Placement step 3 — homes

Status: ''blocked by the secret-custody ruling; remaining homes not wired''.

The daemon document no longer receives an ordinary mirror. The keyhive ceremony now requires a distinct secret document and a sealed-rest capability before it writes founding/admission secret material; the admission copy of persona acts into the daemon document is retired. `PLACE-RULING.md` records why a live sealed-rest enrollment must precede those writes.

The vessel control document and its readers/writers are not yet migrated. Face-bound `bags/daemon-<F>` minting and recipe order also remain unwired. Keep those routes out of scope for any claim that step 3 is complete. The remaining work does not weaken the fail-closed secret boundary.

Tests: keyhive agent ran its full suite (97 files, 560 tests passed) and build/stamp/typecheck before the later node-facing edits. Node full suite ran and failed on secret-home-unavailable across founding/face flows (85 failed files; 454 passed; 11 skipped). No e2e suite run.

Proposed commit subject: `lar:///ha.ka.ba/placement/mints-private-homes`

<<~/ahu>>

